Comment: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:00.58,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:01:26.36,0:01:26.39,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:00.58,Default,OP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:30.34,0:01:32.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Admiral Kizaru\Nhas made landfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.22,0:01:34.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The battle has begun!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:35.00,0:01:36.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let them\Nfire those lasers!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:37.42,0:01:38.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.07,0:02:20.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.80,0:02:29.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those boxes are closing\Nin from all sides!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.16,0:02:29.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.99,0:02:30.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just shoot!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.86,0:02:33.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll get them before\Nthey can get us!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.35,0:02:44.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stand back!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.85,0:02:46.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got this one!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.26,0:02:50.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Steam Knuckles!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.93,0:03:10.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna destroy\Nthose ships?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.56,0:03:15.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have\Nto go through me!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.13,0:03:20.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All the Vice-Admirals\Nhave landed!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.28,0:03:32.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So where's the lab where they're\Nholding the Cipher Pol agents?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.44,0:03:33.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Way up top.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.31,0:03:34.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.40,0:03:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Navy and the robot\Nsea beasts are fighting!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.79,0:03:46.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh man, looks like\Nthey're going all out!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.16,0:03:47.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They should be safe for now.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.66,0:03:50.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sentomaru is still\Nin command of our pacifistas.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.71,0:03:53.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our defenses\Nremain iron-tight.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.55,0:03:54.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And they know that!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.75,0:03:58.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which is the whole reason they\Nsent him after Sentomaru!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.18,0:03:58.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kizaru?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.51,0:04:01.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's on this shore already?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.19,0:04:02.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.24,0:04:04.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Closer!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.20,0:04:05.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's fighting right below us!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.88,0:04:07.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kizaru's here?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.24,0:04:11.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This brings back some unpleasant\Nmemories from our first trip to Sabaody.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.28,0:04:19.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, you're screwed.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.05,0:04:21.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sucks to be you.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.72,0:04:24.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why does he have to fight\NKizaru, of all people?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.10,0:04:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sentomaru!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.48,0:04:28.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't blame you if you\Nchoose to run away!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.57,0:04:29.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a gruesome affair!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.50,0:04:32.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be okay, Stella!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.59,0:04:34.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have time\Nto worry right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.42,0:04:35.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just focus\Non cracking the code!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.83,0:04:39.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got a job!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.38,0:04:41.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Michelle!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.18,0:04:48.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I really would hate\Nto hurt you, friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.38,0:04:52.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you\Nsurrender for me?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.11,0:05:03.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sacred Yasakani Jewel!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.91,0:05:14.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not happy\Nabout this myself!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.09,0:05:15.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I made a promise!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.71,0:05:17.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A deal with Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.72,0:05:20.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.31,0:05:23.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since when are you the kind of man\Nwho makes deals with pirates?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.79,0:05:34.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll take any ally I can get!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.57,0:05:39.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To get him out of here!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.00,0:05:41.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will let him die!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.65,0:05:42.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.91,0:06:01.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.89,0:06:02.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.64,0:06:07.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.75,0:06:09.84,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, ain't that a surprise!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.27,0:06:13.47,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like our gang of bears\Nhas already been taken care of.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.55,0:06:15.72,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Did that child beat\Nthem on his own?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.13,0:06:16.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.37,0:06:21.20,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I lived in the village,\Nbut I won't go back there.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.28,0:06:23.34,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,The people are all\Nweak and stupid.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.73,0:06:24.68,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.76,0:06:26.34,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So they kicked you out, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.42,0:06:29.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm strong enough\Nto wrestle bears.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.44,0:06:32.57,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't get tired or hungry,\Nbut I need a job.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.65,0:06:33.67,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,And I need money.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.40,0:06:37.73,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, is there something\Nimportant you need to buy?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.32,0:06:39.67,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, rice balls.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.34,0:06:53.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were so\Nadorable back then.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.96,0:06:56.41,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So, you need a job.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.95,0:06:58.47,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You've proven your strength.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.55,0:07:00.47,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I could put that to good use.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.55,0:07:03.98,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, boy, what would you say\Nto becoming my bodyguard?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.06,0:07:05.79,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You really want to hire me?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.87,0:07:06.69,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.77,0:07:07.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.94,0:07:13.77,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Uncle!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.98,0:07:15.81,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Uncle!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.54,0:07:17.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.10,0:07:18.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.23,0:07:19.48,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you talking to me?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.56,0:07:20.64,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Help me, Uncle.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.06,0:07:22.51,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never been a bodyguard.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.59,0:07:24.13,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,How should I keep on safe?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.21,0:07:25.98,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid, I am not your uncle.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.39,0:07:28.78,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, at least you're\Nnot calling me Gramps.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.86,0:07:30.61,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Teach me everything\Nyou know.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.69,0:07:31.70,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll train hard!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.81,0:07:38.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I tried my best to teach\Nyou, Sentomaru.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.72,0:07:39.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I really did.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.76,0:07:41.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sumo Strike!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.47,0:07:47.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you forget.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.56,0:07:52.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For as much as you brag\Nabout your defense...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.30,0:07:57.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...mine is just as good.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.18,0:08:25.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come in, pacifistas.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.04,0:08:33.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your previous commander\Nis currently unconscious.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.20,0:08:35.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And your mission\Nhas changed.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.14,0:08:38.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will provide support to the Navy\Nfleet surrounding Egghead.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.81,0:08:40.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sink the Sea Beast weapons!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.65,0:09:09.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We command\Nthe pacifistas now.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.21,0:09:11.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their order was revised.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.82,0:09:14.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quite the waste to sink\Nthose sea beasts.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.98,0:09:17.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But far better to save\Nthe pacifistas.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.79,0:09:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems there's been\Nsizable damage.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.77,0:09:22.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me a report.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.41,0:09:23.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.65,0:09:28.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kizaru just took\Nout Sentomaru!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.68,0:09:29.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He burns!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.72,0:09:41.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to shut down\Nthis defense system immediately!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.74,0:09:42.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.85,0:09:45.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't let Sentomaru's\Nefforts go to waste!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.99,0:09:47.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He bought us his time!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.53,0:09:48.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll never crack it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.90,0:09:50.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I'm Dr. Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.61,0:09:51.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heard of me?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.19,0:09:56.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kizaru is light itself.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.55,0:10:00.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He can get past the laser\Nbarrier in an instant.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.82,0:10:05.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.07,0:10:08.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean we got no\Ndefenses against this guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.62,0:10:09.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.90,0:10:10.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.80,0:10:12.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't... I can't... I can't...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.08,0:10:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are we\Nsupposed to do now?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.28,0:10:17.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He kicked our butts when\Nwe fought him before!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.70,0:10:23.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like we\Nget a round two.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.89,0:10:26.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see how long\Nyour strides last.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.27,0:10:45.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it some hustle, yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.42,0:10:48.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As soon as that barrier comes\Ndown, this ship's gotta fly!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.08,0:10:50.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're doing great,\Ndon't you worry!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.31,0:10:53.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll have everything\Nin position in no time!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.82,0:10:55.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.55,0:11:03.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd better eat while\Nwe still can, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.28,0:11:06.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.72,0:11:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't fight on an empty\Nstomach, I say.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.29,0:11:12.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.86,0:11:14.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could you two try to focus?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.58,0:11:17.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't stuff your faces when\Nwe're about to blast off!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.72,0:11:19.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.05,0:11:23.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lilith!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.97,0:11:25.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that alarm?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.70,0:11:28.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It sounds like somebody broke\Nin, but I don't know how.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.30,0:11:31.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who could get\Nthrough the barrier?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.29,0:11:33.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be\Nimpenetrable!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.76,0:11:49.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They gave me a checklist\Nof things I shouldn't destroy.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.77,0:11:51.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First off is the power plant.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.38,0:11:55.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Followed by Punk Records.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.40,0:11:57.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And York.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.90,0:12:04.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a real pity that my dear old\Nfriend didn't make the list this time.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.80,0:12:09.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The list of what I have\Nto destroy is shorter.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.82,0:12:12.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just one man.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.69,0:12:14.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doctor Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.73,0:12:16.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The barrier was useless!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.84,0:12:18.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kizaru's inside the dome!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.31,0:12:21.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.08,0:12:22.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are Luffy\Nand the others?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.47,0:12:23.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're stuck out\Nthere with him!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.60,0:12:25.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.30,0:12:26.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell them through the snail!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.26,0:12:27.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They have no idea!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.59,0:12:28.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.43,0:12:30.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run for your life!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.26,0:12:35.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our plan won't succeed\Nunless the ship is in position.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.13,0:12:37.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The barrier stays up till then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:08.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stussy!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.36,0:13:10.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.20,0:13:11.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Filthy bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.20,0:13:13.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me borrow this!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.45,0:13:16.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.72,0:13:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why am I the one\Nin the damn bubble?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.50,0:13:21.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's your partner's fault.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.15,0:13:22.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not mine.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.69,0:13:36.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think you own this place\Nbecause your buddy's here?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.88,0:13:39.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't defeat\Nme and Kizaru.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.17,0:13:41.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The noose is tightening\Naround your neck.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.41,0:13:43.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't know what\Nwe're capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.59,0:14:12.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wondered why I didn't see\Ntheir ship on the shoreline.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.21,0:14:14.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at you, sneaking away.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.50,0:14:15.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.08,0:14:18.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kizaru?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.79,0:14:20.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A freakin' admiral?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.60,0:14:22.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's our plan, Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.23,0:14:24.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't tell\Nme he ran off!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.06,0:14:25.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.72,0:14:26.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.44,0:14:40.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.80,0:14:41.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Long time no...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.10,0:14:53.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see your manners\Nhaven't improved.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.39,0:14:56.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll warn you.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.84,0:14:59.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not the same\Nas two years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.80,0:15:01.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're a hundred times better.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.23,0:15:02.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm stronger.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.40,0:15:21.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Invincible\NSlave has returned!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.86,0:15:23.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't know\Nwhat he wants!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.13,0:15:23.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.19,0:15:29.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop him, you fools!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.72,0:15:32.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That monster is\Ndestroying our city!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.09,0:15:50.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't hold him back!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.23,0:16:07.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ursus Shock!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.24,0:16:17.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't die!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.09,0:16:27.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.37,0:16:28.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a slave!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.52,0:16:42.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are\Nyou trying to pull!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.32,0:16:47.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The revolutionaries gave us\Nenough mess to clean up!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.05,0:16:54.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you got an explanation\NI'd love to hear it, Kuma!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.39,0:17:00.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral Sakazuki...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.28,0:17:05.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're useless!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.41,0:17:08.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't rely on you\Nsoldiers for a thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.84,0:17:09.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.60,0:17:10.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.46,0:17:12.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Akainu!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.70,0:17:15.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanted lobster for dinner,\Nbut there was none to be found!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.83,0:17:18.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an unprecedented\Ndisaster!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.93,0:17:21.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's happening to the Holy\NLand's food supply?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.58,0:17:22.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never mind your dinner plans!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.87,0:17:25.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been injured by\Nthis rampaging oaf!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.04,0:17:29.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A disobedient slave\Nmust be dealt with!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.20,0:17:31.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around\Nand kill him already!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.26,0:17:34.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know the deal.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.34,0:17:37.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't let you run\Naround free, Kuma.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.41,0:17:40.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're too dangerous.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.22,0:17:43.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Either we keep you on a leash\Nor we put you in the ground.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.68,0:17:46.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should have lost\Nall sense of identity.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.45,0:17:50.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That makes you as\Ngood as dead already.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.11,0:17:55.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what are you trying\Nto accomplish here?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.83,0:18:06.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Hellhound!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.94,0:18:13.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you could still\Nbleed like a human.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.54,0:18:27.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that's what you get\Nfor turning this into a monster!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.97,0:18:39.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.88,0:19:02.71,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You can bark all you like,\Nbut Kuma's mind is long gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.79,0:19:04.71,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll be reborn as a weapon.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.79,0:19:07.45,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,He even volunteered\Nfor the process.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.53,0:19:08.90,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a liar!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.82,0:19:12.53,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,He'd never do that.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.61,0:19:14.47,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Not unless you forced him to!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.13,0:19:16.84,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't leave me!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.92,0:19:19.19,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't throw\Nhis whole life away!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.30,0:19:25.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.36,0:19:27.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you let Kuma escape?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.50,0:19:29.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you\Ndoing your job?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.78,0:19:32.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the fleet\Nadmiral, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.03,0:19:36.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're just a puppet.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.06,0:19:40.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Think for yourself,\Nor act for yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.89,0:19:44.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So where the hell could you\Nbe going on your own?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.53,0:19:49.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pacifistas and all marines!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.58,0:19:51.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Continue your assault!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.63,0:19:53.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Destroy every last\NSea Beast Weapon!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.55,0:19:54.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Weapons!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.90,0:20:08.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Occupy the Fabriophase!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.89,0:20:10.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're seizing the whole island!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.76,0:20:12.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Admiral Kizaru is\Nabove the clouds!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.88,0:20:14.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's just entered\Nthe Labophase!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.62,0:20:36.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.78,0:20:42.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Black Mamba!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.97,0:20:53.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see how you managed\Nto beat Kaido.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.16,0:20:54.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're certainly tough enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.00,0:20:56.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I wonder...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.15,0:21:01.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What business does a pirate like\Nyou have protecting Dr. Vegapunk?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.74,0:21:04.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're putting a lot\Non the line for him.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.01,0:21:07.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What business do you\Nhave trying to kill him?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.53,0:21:09.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Old Man Apple helped\Nyou guys a lot.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.62,0:21:11.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do you want\Nto get rid of it?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.19,0:21:19.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not that I want to.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.71,0:21:31.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How far up is he going?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.46,0:21:42.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not kill him at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.20,0:21:49.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've known Vegapunk\Nfor a long time.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.11,0:21:55.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So to be frank, I don't\Nneed to hear your opinion.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.93,0:22:02.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acceleration is power.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.71,0:22:23.25,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It's name is Vegaforce-01!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.21,0:22:27.32,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So dream of all mankind!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.49,0:22:30.86,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a giant robot!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:45.07,0:22:46.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.63,0:23:13.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank God evil never dies.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.46,0:23:24.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lilith!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.73,0:23:29.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta run!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.68,0:23:32.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Vegaforce-01 is gonna...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.23,0:24:06.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Vegaforce-01 was\Nthe dream of mankind!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.59,0:24:07.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's it, bro.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.66,0:24:08.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are gonna pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.48,0:24:11.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is the Sunny all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.50,0:24:14.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.41,0:24:15.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Might wanna check\Non Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.61,0:24:17.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, while you're at it!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.82,0:24:28.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kizaru, you bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.49,0:24:36.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, I hardly\Nrecognized you, Bonney.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.10,0:24:37.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My word.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:37.64,0:24:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kids these days\Ngrow up real fast.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.74,0:24:45.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what's your stake in this?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.85,0:24:48.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you want to take revenge\Non Vegapunk yourself?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.50,0:24:52.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you mad we're gonna\Nbeat you to the punch?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.02,0:24:54.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:56.34,0:24:59.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk isn't the one\NI'm trying to kill anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.34,0:25:04.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Age Skewer!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.07,0:25:06.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.91,0:25:13.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not part of my mission.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.98,0:25:19.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So don't make me shoot down\Nanother acquaintance, please.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:20.74,0:25:21.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.96,0:25:24.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The barrier!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.80,0:25:25.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.15,0:25:33.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough, Kizaru!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.69,0:25:34.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're done for!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.05,0:25:38.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Radical!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.50,0:25:47.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait... He's gone?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.16,0:25:48.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kizaru!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:48.67,0:25:49.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.24,0:25:51.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stella's in danger.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.77,0:25:53.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, call the control room!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.23,0:26:01.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yo, control room!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.63,0:26:02.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Franky!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.49,0:26:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.40,0:26:05.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just heard a big\Nexplosion over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.76,0:26:06.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Never mind me.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.76,0:26:07.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you guys safe?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.88,0:26:09.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.55,0:26:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.53,0:26:12.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, guess he's not there yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:12.58,0:26:13.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lucky break.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:13.75,0:26:15.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are making me nervous.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.94,0:26:17.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is done!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.74,0:26:20.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That puny encryption\Nwas no match for us.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.48,0:26:23.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're free!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.24,0:26:26.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice work!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.66,0:26:30.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat that, York!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.84,0:26:31.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You lose!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.38,0:26:35.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You stupid pumpkin geniuses!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:36.28,0:26:37.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello, Franky.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.53,0:26:40.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can deactivate\Nthe barrier any time you like.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.14,0:26:43.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you move the Vegaforce-01\Nand the ship to the back side yet?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.23,0:26:43.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.98,0:26:44.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's complicated.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.00,0:26:53.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hate to be the bearer of bad news,\Nbut your escape plan is a bust.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.52,0:26:58.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello, old friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.02,0:27:06.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When did you get here?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.16,0:27:07.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.02,0:27:09.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what did you do to Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.75,0:27:11.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You didn't kill him, did you?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:11.44,0:27:12.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're so... dead.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.28,0:27:16.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you the cause\Nof that explosion earlier?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:17.26,0:27:18.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.54,0:27:21.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was a bit of a tragedy.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:22.56,0:27:26.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That robot you loved\Nso much... I blew it up.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.40,0:27:28.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:29.19,0:27:30.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:32.72,0:27:34.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want you to understand\Nsomething.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.67,0:27:37.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This mission is\Nvery difficult for me.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:38.28,0:27:40.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not draw this out.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.03,0:27:49.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.91,0:27:51.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:51.23,0:27:52.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've suffered enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:56.01,0:27:56.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.07,0:28:02.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.39,0:28:03.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:09.66,0:28:10.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Phew!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:20.17,0:28:21.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is spicy!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:25.09,0:28:25.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're back, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:25.61,0:28:29.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So this must be...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:30.92,0:28:33.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess you survived\Nthe Zappy Barrier twice!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.77,0:28:35.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, you threw me\Ninto that thing fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:35.94,0:28:37.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyone smell burnt rubber?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.15,0:22:19.94,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It's complete!
